      <description><![CDATA[<h3>iPod Drop 2.6.2</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>No more stuck "iPod is busy".</b> If your iPod couldn't read one of its song files while you removed songs, iPod Drop could stay busy until you quit it, blocking adding, editing and removing. It now carries on, removes the song, and tells you which songs couldn't be copied to Recently Removed.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
